19:["$","p","9",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"This is where most people stall. They make the folders and stare at an empty directory. Don't. Dump everything you already have: saved articles, call transcripts, meeting notes, research, podcast notes, video summaries, old project notes, screenshots."}]
1a:["$","div","10",{"className":"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-5 py-4 leading-[1.7] text-ink","children":"No existing material? Open a Claude chat and talk for 20 minutes about your work, your goals, and what you're building. Save it as Memory.md and drop it in raw-sources/. That's enough to make your first session feel like Claude actually knows you."}]
1b:["$","h2","11",{"className":"mt-12 t-h3 text-ink","children":"Step 4: Tell Claude to build the wiki"}]
1c:["$","p","12",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"Point Claude Code at your vault folder and run this, then walk away and let it work."}]
1d:["$","div","13",{"className":"mt-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[12px] text-ink-dim","children":"Copy and paste"}],["$","$L2a",null,{"text":"claude -p \"Read everything in /raw-sources/. Compile a wiki in /wiki/ following\nthe rules in CLAUDE.md. Create an index.md first, then one .md file per major\ntopic. Link related topics using [[topic-name]] format. Summarize every source.\nLog everything to log.md.\" --allowedTools Bash,Write,Read"}]]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"rounded-xl bg-[#0a1020] p-5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-[#e4e9f5] overflow-x-auto","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"claude -p \"Read everything in /raw-sources/. Compile a wiki in /wiki/ following\nthe rules in CLAUDE.md. Create an index.md first, then one .md file per major\ntopic. Link related topics using [[topic-name]] format. Summarize every source.\nLog everything to log.md.\" --allowedTools Bash,Write,Read"}]}]]}]
1e:["$","p","14",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"When it's done you'll have a wiki full of organized articles, connections you didn't see, summaries of things you forgot you saved, and an index that makes everything searchable in seconds."}]
