20:["$","p","16",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"Three operations you'll use on repeat. First, ingest new sources. Install the Obsidian Web Clipper extension, clip an article into raw-sources/, then tell Claude:"}]
